1
00:00:08,714 --> 00:00:11,504
(Sheldon:)Oh, there's my missing neutrino.

2
00:00:11,676 --> 00:00:14,136
(Sheldon:)You were hiding from me
as an unbalanced charge...

3
00:00:14,303 --> 00:00:17,143
(Sheldon:)...weren't you,
you little subatomic dickens?

4
00:00:18,057 --> 00:00:20,897
- Hi, Sheldon.
- Hey, look, I found my missing neutrino.

5
00:00:21,060 --> 00:00:23,690
(Howard:)Oh, good,
we can take it off the milk carton.

6
00:00:25,398 --> 00:00:27,728
We're gonna apologize to Raj
and invite him out to dinner.

7
00:00:27,900 --> 00:00:29,730
Apologize? For what?

8
00:00:29,902 --> 00:00:34,112
(Leonard:)He came over last night with some pretty
good news and we weren't very supportive.

9
00:00:35,283 --> 00:00:37,703
(Sheldon:)I sense you're trying
to tell me something.

10
00:00:38,244 --> 00:00:41,374
(Howard:)You were a colossal asshat.

11
00:00:41,914 --> 00:00:45,124
Oh, no, I beg to differ.

12
00:00:45,293 --> 00:00:47,753
(Sheldon:)Of the three of us,
I was by far the most supportive.

13
00:00:47,920 --> 00:00:49,590
Really? Do tell.

14
00:00:49,755 --> 00:00:53,425
(Sheldon:)How will Raj ever reach true greatness
if his friends lower the bar for him?

15
00:00:53,884 --> 00:00:58,054
When I was 11, my sister bought our father
a "world's greatest dad" coffee mug.

16
00:00:58,222 --> 00:01:02,022
(Sheldon:)And frankly, the man coasted
until the day he died.

